    <footnotes>
        <footnote id="F1">Represents securities owned directly by Opaleye, L.P. (the &quot;Fund&quot;). As the investment manager of the Fund, Opaleye Management Inc. may be deemed to beneficially own the securities owned directly by the Fund.</footnote>
